 vary proportionally. This demonstrates the constancy of the ratio of the magnitude of any such vector to the magnitude of \\vec{OA}. The effectiveness of this solution is justified by the fact that it demonstrates the constancy of the ratio of the magnitude of any such vector to the magnitude of \\vec{OA} in a clear and meaningful way in a different context with a detailed explanation, including the implications of your solution.",
